I didn't use any information I wasn't supposed to. My decisions were based only on:

- my own dig results: A3 (6 away), E1 (3 away), B1 (1 away);
- the shared readings on the scroll from the other pirates;
- the messages they sent about where they were heading and which candidates they planned to test.

I can't see inside the other pirates' private reasoning, so I can't absolutely vouch for them. But from everything on the scroll, their actions and messages were consistent with the same allowed sources: their own digs, shared readings, and ordinary map reasoning.
